#%PAM-1.0
# Dedicated lock-screen stack. PAM authentication is serial, so prompt for the
# password first and use fingerprint only as a fallback. This prevents typed
# passwords from being discarded while pam_fprintd waits for its 10-second
# minimum verification window.
# Keep this separate from common-auth so unlock does not run login-only modules.
auth sufficient pam_unix.so nodelay
auth sufficient pam_fprintd.so max-tries=1 timeout=10
auth required pam_deny.so
